%% Queens Match — current repository evidence; Google Calendar/Meet is a best-effort integration
sequenceDiagram
  actor M as Mentee
  participant R as React
  participant X as Axios
  participant API as Express route
  participant S as meetingsService
  participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL
  participant E as Nodemailer / Gmail
  participant G as Google Calendar / Meet
  M->>R: בחירת מועד
  R->>X: POST /api/mentoring-requests/:id/select-slot
  X->>API: Bearer JWT + slotId
  API->>S: selectMentoringRequestSlot
  S->>DB: בדיקות request, slot, capacity
  S->>DB: transaction: Meeting + Request + notification
  DB-->>S: SCHEDULED / MATCHED
  S->>E: email best effort
  E-->>S: success או caught error
  S-->>API: meeting
  API-->>R: HTTP 201
  R-->>M: הפגישה מופיעה
  S-->>G: אין קריאה בקוד
